    {"type":"text","id":"intent_off_label","x":350,"y":1410,"width":150,"height":36,"text":"用户 OFF\nREADY 时进入 RESTORING","originalText":"用户 OFF\nREADY 时进入 RESTORING","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#6d28d9","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":30115,"version":1,"versionNonce":30116,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"intent_preserve_note","x":100,"y":1470,"width":670,"height":50,"text":"systemWillSleep / deviceRemoved / FAILED 都不修改 INTENT ON；\n设备重新可用时，CHANNEL_READY 自动继续 DISCOVERING","originalText":"systemWillSleep / deviceRemoved / FAILED 都不修改 INTENT ON；\n设备重新可用时，CHANNEL_READY 自动继续 DISCOVERING","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":30117,"version":1,"versionNonce":30118,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

    {"type":"rectangle","id":"generation_panel","x":880,"y":1300,"width":570,"height":230,"strokeColor":"#1e293b","backgroundColor":"#1e293b","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":30201,"version":1,"versionNonce":30202,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"generation_panel_text","x":910,"y":1325,"width":510,"height":180,"text":"generation 代际规则\n\nSTARTING / WAKING / transport replacement -> generation++\n每个 raw callback、异步命令、retryTimer 都捕获 generation\n\nguard event.generation == state.generation else {\n  return  // 丢弃睡眠前或旧设备的迟到结果\n}","originalText":"generation 代际规则\n\nSTARTING / WAKING / transport replacement -> generation++\n每个 raw callback、异步命令、retryTimer 都捕获 generation\n\nguard event.generation == state.generation else {\n  return  // 丢弃睡眠前或旧设备的迟到结果\n}","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#22c55e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":30203,"version":1,"versionNonce":30204,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

    {"type":"rectangle","id":"verified_panel","x":1540,"y":1300,"width":650,"height":230,"strokeColor":"#dc2626","backgroundColor":"#fee2e2","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":30205,"version":1,"versionNonce":30206,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"verified_panel_text","x":1570,"y":1325,"width":590,"height":180,"text":"verifiedAxes 安全规则\n\n仅 CONFIGURING / VERIFYING 完成 SetMode + GetMode 后设置\n进入 SUSPENDING、ABSENT、FAILED、RESTORING 时立即清空\n\n输出条件：\nlifecycle == RUNNING\n&& device == READY\n&& takeoverRequested\n&& verifiedAxes.contains(axis)\n否则 CGEvent 必须 fail-open","originalText":"verifiedAxes 安全规则\n\n仅 CONFIGURING / VERIFYING 完成 SetMode + GetMode 后设置\n进入 SUSPENDING、ABSENT、FAILED、RESTORING 时立即清空\n\n输出条件：\nlifecycle == RUNNING\n&& device == READY\n&& takeoverRequested\n&& verifiedAxes.contains(axis)\n否则 CGEvent 必须 fail-open","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":30207,"version":1,"versionNonce":30208,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

    {"type":"line","id":"invariant_divider","x":70,"y":1590,"width":2160,"height":0,"strokeColor":"#93c5fd","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"dashed","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":30301,"version":1,"versionNonce":30302,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0,0],[2160,0]]},
    {"type":"text","id":"invariant_heading","x":70,"y":1620,"width":850,"height":32,"text":"4. 协调器 reducer 的全局不变量","originalText":"4. 协调器 reducer 的全局不变量","fontSize":25,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#1e40af","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":30303,"version":1,"versionNonce":30304,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"rectangle","id":"invariant_box","x":90,"y":1685,"width":2100,"height":245,"strokeColor":"#047857","backgroundColor":"#a7f3d0","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":30305,"version":1,"versionNonce":30306,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"invariant_box_text","x":125,"y":1715,"width":2030,"height":185,"text":"1. 只有 MouseRuntimeCoordinator 可以修改 MouseRuntimeState；Monitor 只发送 Event，Controller 只执行 Command 并返回 Result。\n2. lifecycle != RUNNING 时，device 必须是 ABSENT，verifiedAxes 必须为空，任何滚动抑制都 fail-open。\n3. device == READY 必须携带当前 generation 的 DeviceSession；旧 route、slot、feature index 永不跨 generation 复用。\n4. takeoverRequested 是用户长期意图，睡眠、插拔和临时失败不能清除；只有用户 OFF 或终止流程改变它。\n5. 所有失败路径有界：清可信状态 -> 最多三次重试 -> WAITING_EVENT；禁止递归无限扫描。\n6. applicationWillTerminate 优先级最高：拒绝新事件，取消重试，可写则恢复硬件，最终一定释放 callback/run-loop source。\n7. UI 完全由聚合状态派生，不允许 DeviceConnectionMonitor 的“存在”直接覆盖 HID++ 可用性或 READY。","originalText":"1. 只有 MouseRuntimeCoordinator 可以修改 MouseRuntimeState；Monitor 只发送 Event，Controller 只执行 Command 并返回 Result。\n2. lifecycle != RUNNING 时，device 必须是 ABSENT，verifiedAxes 必须为空，任何滚动抑制都 fail-open。\n3. device == READY 必须携带当前 generation 的 DeviceSession；旧 route、slot、feature index 永不跨 generation 复用。\n4. takeoverRequested 是用户长期意图，睡眠、插拔和临时失败不能清除；只有用户 OFF 或终止流程改变它。\n5. 所有失败路径有界：清可信状态 -> 最多三次重试 -> WAITING_EVENT；禁止递归无限扫描。\n6. applicationWillTerminate 优先级最高：拒绝新事件，取消重试，可写则恢复硬件，最终一定释放 callback/run-loop source。\n7. UI 完全由聚合状态派生，不允许 DeviceConnectionMonitor 的“存在”直接覆盖 HID++ 可用性或 READY。","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":30307,"version":1,"versionNonce":30308,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25}
  ],
  "appState":{"viewBackgroundColor":"#ffffff","gridSize":20},
  "files":{}
}
